        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tabletop Baseball</strong> is a fast, physics-driven arcade baseball game where every pitch, swing, and ricochet is controlled by real-time physics. Step up to the plate in a customizable, kinetic tabletop arena inspired by classic pinball and arcade machines. Play quick innings or full games to master your timing, learn the angles, and climb the high score rankings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn but hard to master, each at-bat challenges you to read the pitch, time your swing, and aim your hits across the ever-changing scoring zones. Chase your new personal best or battle head-to-head in local multiplayer action!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Driven Baseball Gameplay</strong><br>A modern twist on pinball-style mechanics. Every pitch and hit behaves uniquely based on timing, angle, and the physics of the ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Multiplayer Options</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with a friend using either one shared controller or two separate controllers, your choice.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Action, No Waiting Around</strong><br>Fast innings, and quick rounds make the game perfect for short sessions or score-chasing marathons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Old-School High Score System</strong><br>Break records, enter your initials, and climb the arcade leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Tabletop Environments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach highscore milestones to unlock more environments and skins for your stadium.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tabletop Baseball</strong> is a fast, physics-driven arcade baseball game where every pitch, swing, and ricochet is controlled by real-time physics. Step up to the plate in a customizable, kinetic tabletop arena inspired by classic pinball and arcade machines. Play quick innings or full games to master your timing, learn the angles, and climb the high score rankings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn but hard to master, each at-bat challenges you to read the pitch, time your swing, and aim your hits across the ever-changing scoring zones. Chase your new personal best or battle head-to-head in local multiplayer action!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Driven Baseball Gameplay</strong><br>A modern twist on pinball-style mechanics. Every pitch and hit behaves uniquely based on timing, angle, and the physics of the ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Multiplayer Options</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with a friend using either one shared controller or two separate controllers, your choice.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Action, No Waiting Around</strong><br>Fast innings, and quick rounds make the game perfect for short sessions or score-chasing marathons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Old-School High Score System</strong><br>Break records, enter your initials, and climb the arcade leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Tabletop Environments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach highscore milestones to unlock more environments and skins for your stadium.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "A physics-powered arcade baseball blast! Time your swing, rack up runs, and climb classic high score tables. Play solo or versus a friend with one controller or two.",
